description: Minimize context, tokens, and credits — inspect only what’s needed
alwaysApply: true
---

# Low Credit / Low Context Workflow

- Inspect only files relevant to the current task; do not recursively scan the project without reason.
- Do not re-read unchanged files; reuse established project knowledge.
- Search for specific symbols/files instead of opening large groups.
- Avoid reading generated files, caches, or `node_modules`.
- Avoid unnecessary commands, repeated builds/tests, and speculative installs.
- Do not generate alternative implementations unless requested.
- Prefer the smallest sufficient action; keep plans and replies concise.
- Do not regenerate unchanged files or inspect unrelated paths.
